WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Support your forearm. Relax your hand.
Touching the fingertip is optional.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Move the thumb toward one fingertip.
Return to rest before the next.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Pause. Do not pry the hand open.
Use your own comfortable range.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Watch the thumb approach again.
Contact is not required.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Rest your hand.
Stop for pain or increased tightness.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A final example, at normal speed.
Your hand may move differently.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Relax and reflect.
Which part felt easiest?
